        {
            "id": "e13cd0ca-9652-4928-80fe-e7f5b2da5cbb",
            "build_id": "223307cc-dd15-473b-89bc-5babd95d0491",
            "round_number": 3,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-10-01T23:29:21.206409+00:00",
            "notes": "This is where you start to build your ability power--[Icy Veins](item_2c403951-4f9b-4390-ad1e-aabaa09a6da5) is absolutely crucial for the rest of the match and the entire build centers around this item. I like to keep the move speed as long as I can.\n\nOriginally, I would use [Permafrost](item_9ec90639-d474-409d-9a37-905749bc97de) in the 3rd round to help with my survivability but [Cryclone](item_e64001ed-c334-4bd9-8621-03f94efcac07) is the better choice if you need to play more aggressively and output more damage.\n\nI know a lot of people love [Coulder](item_12ad88e8-650a-44ec-b1e1-a39646055d68) but I have only used it a couple of times with this build and ultimately don't care for it here. This is entirely due to the benefits of the other powers later on in the match. Whatever damage you may deal with [Coulder](item_12ad88e8-650a-44ec-b1e1-a39646055d68) is made up for by the blizzards in [Cryclone](item_e64001ed-c334-4bd9-8621-03f94efcac07) and [Snowball Flight](item_770c6b61-98a8-489f-b44e-c1cc65c0cd7d), plus you get one extra evasive maneuver. Cool down reduction will aid in your ability to stay alive.\n\n**IMPORTANT NOTE**\nBetween [Permafrost](item_9ec90639-d474-409d-9a37-905749bc97de) and [Blizznado](item_208ab663-2529-489a-87d9-d798d94f4c22) I only apply one per game, it's up to your discretion which one would be more useful to you. [Permafrost](item_9ec90639-d474-409d-9a37-905749bc97de) is better earlier on but [Blizznado](item_208ab663-2529-489a-87d9-d798d94f4c22) is almost essential at the end of the game.",
